abstract: >-
  Offline documentary reproduction of a fixed-population fidelity audit:
  64 disagreements in 768 sampled maintenance reports, an upper total
  of 200/2048, and a subsequent census with 158 disagreements.
  The guarantee assumes a fixed disagreement table and uniform sampling
  without replacement. Licensing is scoped in LICENSES.md.
